%% LearningOS graph template — kind: progress
%% Static frame only. Slice lines are generated from the graph artefact JSON by
%% graphs/mermaid.py. Placeholders:
%%   {{TITLE}}         graph title
%%   {{GENERATED_AT}}  ISO-8601 UTC timestamp from the artefact
%%   {{SUBJECT_IDS}}   comma-separated subject ids
%%   {{SLICES}}        one `"<status label>" : <count>` line per status, sorted
%% A pie chart is appropriate here because the quantity really is a partition of one set: every
%% concept has exactly one status. Counts, not percentages, are written into the labels so the
%% numbers are readable without the chart.
%% title: {{TITLE}}
%% generated_at: {{GENERATED_AT}}
%% subjects: {{SUBJECT_IDS}}
pie title Concept status distribution
{{SLICES}}
